{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And you shall stone him with stones, and he shall die.</b> According to the way of the masters of blessed memory in the Zohar (vol. 3, 112a), in the sod of ״שְׁמַע יִשְׂרָאֵל״, that it contains five stones with which they stone Samael in harsh judgment and he dies." "And the verse says <b>and all Israel shall hear and fear</b>, for when Israel sees their reading [of the verse] and the reason for their reading, they shall hear and increase their fear of HaShem, as the masters of blessed memory said there regarding that story of the pious man (Kiddushin 39b)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:17:15.286201737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}